  "phase": "phase-3",
  "approved": true,
  "summary": "Phase 3: visuospatial cues + distance axis. Replaced the Phase 1/2 text cue with 8 SVG pictograph components (one per cue id) sourced from a data-driven CUE_PALETTE map so adding a new cue is purely additive (palette entry + library entry, no engine change). Each pictograph has its own CSS-keyframe animation. Added a Distance type (far/mid/in_range), per-cue byDistance rule table on the library, and engine helpers pickDistance + resolveCueAtDistance. classifyRep now takes isGo directly so the distance-resolved value drives classification. Reaction time is now rounded at the engine boundary (Math.round in classifyRep) — single source of truth. Three new Settings → Visuals toggles: distance axis on/off, distance audio tone on/off, text label overlay on/off. CueStage renders the pictograph at far=0.45, mid=0.7, in_range=1.0 scale and optionally shows the text overlay. Optional Web Audio oscillator tone (220/440/660 Hz per distance)
