an, tsc clean, 81/81 tests pass, build clean. qa-playwright re-verified both fixes PASS plus a bonus regression PASS with zero console errors.\n\nPlease re-review **just** the DRY fix and the migration tests. Is the blocking finding resolved? Are there any new DRY/drift concerns introduced by the slim shape (especially around the migration path and the `LegacySettingsFields` type that bridges old data → new schema)? Under 200 words. Return APPROVE / REQUEST_CHANGES."}
