[text] Phase 4 complete.

**Summary:**
- Drill profiles are first-class Dexie v3 records with full CRUD (Settings → Profile section + New / Rename / Delete; cannot delete the only remaining profile).
- `SettingsRecord` slimmed to device prefs only (`commitKey*`, `inputSource`, `activeProfileId`); Phase 2/3 rows migrate into a seeded `Default` profile via `readLegacySettingsOverrides`.
- `loadActiveProfile` uses an in-flight promise singleton so StrictMode double-mount cannot double-seed.
- Classifier now treats `lateThresholdMs` as first-class (defaults 450/600/1200); presses in the band classify as `hesitation`, past `lateThresholdMs` classify as `late` even within the window.
- `allowedCueIds` + `scoreWeights` configurable per profile; `validateDrillConfig` enforces threshold ordering and "at least one go cue".
- Summary screen adds per-cue breakdown table + Rhythm-pattern narrative via new pure `antiRhythmSignal`.
- 21 new tests (81 total); lint/tsc/build clean.
- Reviewer **APPROVE** after one round of changes (DRY fix); qa-playwright **PASS** all 6 criteria + Phase 3 regression; both QA-flagged defects (StrictMode double-seed, settings staleness) fixed and re-verified with zero console errors.
- `artifacts/decision-memo.md` and `artifacts/phase-approval.json` written. Stopping for the commit gate.
